{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午11時許，一輛警車在元朗公路近朗天路往上水方向懷疑起火冒煙，途經駕駛者見狀報案。</p><p>消防接報趕至，動用兩條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救，約15分鐘後將火救熄，警車車頭嚴重熏黑。</p><p>事件中無人受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.612413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:46:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:18:04.674537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"b9b3c7aa68b1ae3e7cac07fced960daa81140270964e115f5bc84ec89876d4de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}